```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "walk a wiki's memes folder and ingest it into its canonical bag"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.wiki.syncs", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.wiki.syncs"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.wiki.syncs"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.wiki.syncs ~ the workbench's memes ingest, idempotent

`lares wiki sync <slug>` asks the daemon to walk `wikis/<slug>/memes/**` and ingest each carrier into the wiki's canonical bag, naming every error. Idempotent.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ sync

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`sync` params=`slug/works ~ ingest the wiki's memes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/slug needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki slug`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.wiki.syncs slug/works]] ~ name the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's sync-wiki verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ synced

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`synced` params=`exit/0 fields/[[errors]] ~ the ingest's counts and any errors`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki sync

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares wiki sync]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

